WEBVTT


00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:02.340
Located in the heart of downtown LA,

00:00:02.341 --> 00:00:03.901
you'll find this unique jazz bar

00:00:03.902 --> 00:00:07.301
serving up incredible vibes and some pretty solid comfort food.

00:00:07.302 --> 00:00:10.541
We started at the bar for some strong drinks to set the mood right.

00:00:10.542 --> 00:00:13.721
Then came the truffle mushroom pie and Creole shrimp pasta.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:15.301
The live music was so good,

00:00:15.302 --> 00:00:17.661
I had to ask the worker for this guy's Spotify,

00:00:17.662 --> 00:00:19.961
and apparently his name is Matthew Grant.

00:00:20.020 --> 00:00:21.420
They have a different event every day,

00:00:21.421 --> 00:00:24.800
so check their calendar. But this is such a cool spot for a date.
